<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 20pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ZTO EXPRESS (CAYMAN)&#160;INC. </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">FOR THE YEARS ENDED </b><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman Bold';font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;">December</b><b style="font-weight:bold;"> 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Amounts in thousands, except for share and per share data, unless otherwise stated)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;background:#ffffff;min-height:11.5pt;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_OL3m4oDhLUaCzvu2nmPW3A_cont1"><ix:continuation id="Group_8En5-U3TRk683P_pxwJjaQ_cont1" continuedAt="Group_8En5-U3TRk683P_pxwJjaQ_2"></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">8. Investments in equity investees (Continued)</b></p><ix:continuation id="Group_8En5-U3TRk683P_pxwJjaQ_2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">ZTO LTL provides less-than-truckload transportation services in China. The Company has significant influence over ZTO Freight (Cayman) Inc. (&#8220;ZTO Freight&#8221;), a Cayman parent company of ZTO LTL, through <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_XH5U-e4P3EyaYDdbgpgGqw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZtoFreightCaymanIncMember_8WkqC7FZr0e1ShkBlghyQA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Pq023BOaPUqgmvzDEtXpFg">18</ix:nonFraction>% equity ownership interest in the common stock of ZTO Freight for a total consideration of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_qF0kSPXROUmXco8Ic_aVpw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZtoFreightCaymanIncMember_od0lIwXkf0KvDmPQ9ZJvFw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireEquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_rf3g_5OGr0-Zspyf8gxSFQ">14,017</ix:nonFraction> (RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_xSGriXam1kKF-vMyssHgcw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZtoFreightCaymanIncMember_od0lIwXkf0KvDmPQ9ZJvFw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireEquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_tpWVoJmWHEasDa6X-TM3lw">99,519</ix:nonFraction>), and accounts for this investment using the equity method. The Company also invested US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_qF0kSPXROUmXco8Ic_aVpw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZtoFreightCaymanIncMember_8WkqC7FZr0e1ShkBlghyQA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zto:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueOriginalCost" scale="3" id="Narr_059fsqSfpEGL0bbGyHHBAA">83,817</ix:nonFraction> (RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_xSGriXam1kKF-vMyssHgcw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZtoFreightCaymanIncMember_8WkqC7FZr0e1ShkBlghyQA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zto:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueOriginalCost" scale="3" id="Narr_xme8IJo8YkOdL5TMJTTQZg">582,526</ix:nonFraction>) in preferred stock of ZTO Freight, which is accounted under the measurement alternative given that the underlying preferred shares are not considered in-substance common stock and have no readily determinable fair value.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In December 2025, the Company received RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_xSGriXam1kKF-vMyssHgcw" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2025_To_12_24_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZtoFreightCaymanIncMember_lWoMUXuPDkCklDwOz-8sVg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromEquityMethodInvestmentDividendsOrDistributionsReturnOfCapital" scale="3" id="Narr_-wn_LWfwbEuY8FvBZu4hUw">686,293</ix:nonFraction> from ZTO Freight as part of a group-level reorganization arrangement, representing the return of its original investment amount in ZTO Freight. The Company subsequently made a corresponding investment in ZTO LTL in early 2026. Through a series of contractual agreements entered into contemporaneously with ZTO Freight&#8217;s shareholders, the Company&#8217;s economic interest in the ZTO LTL group remained unchanged throughout the arrangement. The amount received as of December 31, 2025 was recorded in amount due to related parties in consolidated balance sheets.</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;tex