ostMember_0s06yBFFb0KYFRSDb_kAgg" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zto:EquityInvestmentsWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValuesOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_u0a09Y5s0k-9Ynx9-sSI0w">13.75</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_XH5U-e4P3EyaYDdbgpgGqw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZhejiangYizhanNetworkTechnologyCoLtdCainiaoPostMember_gnUUB4ZOOUqj7FDQYlIyBQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zto:EquityInvestmentsWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValuesOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_0eRguFpDSky8_7qM16AiXA">13.75</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest in Cainiao Post, respectively. Since the Company doesn&#8217;t have significant influence over Cainiao Post, this investment is accounted for as an equity investment without readily determinable fair values. The Company recorded a provision for impairment of RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_xSGriXam1kKF-vMyssHgcw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZhejiangYizhanNetworkTechnologyCoLtdCainiaoPostMember_NjOhady9a0S4NSXHMad6eg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueImpairmentLossAnnualAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_MgMggyZ_KEW9q9X8JjfaNg">451,436</ix:nonFraction> due to underperformance of the investee for the year ended December 31, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Company recognized impairment losses totaling <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_xSGriXam1kKF-vMyssHgcw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_zto_ZhijiangNewIndustriesLimitedZjNewIndustriesMember_Su28MZnIDUiAVxGOwVzAIg" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadil