Group granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_GN_cCd8_Zku9W0PJj8TX2w" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2025_To_3_31_2025_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_zto_CertainDirectorsMembersOfManagementAndEmployeesMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_lKSPBMwHY0qXaw3W1A-KpA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_rDY4L1cU-UOwYJDH6AskRw">454,997</ix:nonFraction> RSU at par value to certain directors, executive offices and employees pursuant to the 2024 Share Incentive Plan. These grants are vested immediately upon grant. The Group recorded the share-based compensation of RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_xSGriXam1kKF-vMyssHgcw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_zto_CertainDirectorsMembersOfManagementAndEmployeesMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_yPOc_ulqmUC_GnxLVwHZWQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_iCdW5rZ0QkaxZhac8Y0K6Q">66,127</ix:nonFraction> based on the market price of ordinary shares at US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_8k9rXZEOFkCLow36Uyv2xQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_zto_CertainDirectorsMembersOfManagementAndEmployeesMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_Wnp8-h9OIEmfdeghkpj7cw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_vq0qz1_tRkOChxJwJAWNbw">20.05</ix:nonFraction> on the grant date for the year ended December 31, 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 36pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Share Options</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 22, 2024, the Company granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_GN_cCd8_Zku9W0PJj8TX2w" contextRef="Duration_3_22_2024_To_3_22_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_F_pqRPIvGE67qIrkV2LYNQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_ftDLVtqKIUOxBT3R9bt7cA">916,200</ix:nonFraction> share options to certain director, executive offices and employees pursuant to the 2024 Share Incentive Plan. The exercise price is US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_8k9rXZEOFkCLow36Uyv2xQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_22_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_svNF-eLlFEKUzTOTfb2zcQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExercisePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_rjwRv2nol0u9Gar65ZJKZg">21.88</ix:nonFraction>. The options will be vested <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_XH5U-e4P3EyaYDdbgpgGqw" contextRef="Duration_3_22_2024_To_3_22_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_us-gaap_VestingAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMember_4RVBWuTDSEqVznkRWtKixg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_5MncgG1qXkSn_2GC15qnHg">33</ix:nonFraction>%, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_XH5U-e4P3EyaYDdbgpgGqw" contextRef="Duration_3_22_2024_To_3_22_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_us-gaap_VestingAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMember_rr__R5o4ukWGDSfBfkRPHA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_EVfbQuxoLEmjqxVLJwCOhQ">33</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_XH5U-e4P3EyaYDdbgpgGqw" contextRef="Duration_3_22_2024_To_3_22_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_us-gaap_VestingAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheThreeMember_6xpO7kjsfE2OjZGSIiVpEQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_cQzrdYH2yEKrj2qKMM0aRw">34</ix:nonFraction>% on each of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_Am9BFDHBTUmA6XWBYSNrfw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three</span></span> anniversary dates from the grant date, respectively. The options have a contractual term of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_22_2024_To_3_22_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_F_pqRPIvGE67qIrkV2LYNQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_f465Wi7F6ka-oo-LlgLc2w">ten years</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s share options are valued at fair value on the date of grant and that fair value is recognized as selling, general and administrative expenses in the consolidated statements of comprehensive income over the requisite service period using the accelerated attribution method. The closing price of the Company&#8217;s shares immediately before March 22, 2024, the date of grant, was US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_8k9rXZEOFkCLow36Uyv2xQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_21_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_DMbFMNbiqkiAE1Qvs0CwLQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_JJKOFAmlw0Ku51eL3i_VjA">21.67</ix:nonFraction> per share. The weighted-average grant date fair value for options granted to directors and employees during the year ended December 31, 2024 was US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_8k9rXZEOFkCLow36Uyv2xQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_zto_ShareIncentivePlan2024Member_HNIlSObbekmXE7JtYoYubw" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_S34mTVly1U2K7w_e1Q9OBg">6.7</ix:nonFraction> per share, computed using the binomial option pricing model. The binomial option pricing model requires the input of subjective assumptions including the expected stock price volatility and the expected price multiple at which employees are likely to exercise stock options. Expected volatilities are based on the average historical equity volatility of the Company. The risk-free rate for periods within the contractual life of the option is based on the U.S. Treasury yield curve in effect at the time of grant.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The fair value of stock options was estimated using the following significant assumptions:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_5thzZQv0lEmmjN0BhcOUQA" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedPaymentAwardStockOptionsValuationAssumptionsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_rph8MTJ8YUC1QovGH0DsOA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:82.59%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-w